                     ✘\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ✘\n\n                                         mances typically relies on attribute statistics such as tim-                  Fréchet Music Distance\n                                                                                                                       Kernel Music Distance\n                                                                                                                                                         ✔\n                                                                                                                                                         ✔\n                                                                                                                                                                     ✔\n                                                                                                                                                                     ✔\n                                                                                                                                                                                    ✔\n                                                                                                                                                                                    ✔\n                                                                                                                                                                                                   ✘\n                                                                                                                                                                                                   ✘\n                                                      